    "class": "DUPLICATED_POLICY_AUTHORITY_DRIFT",
    "description": "The Airlock policy and Phoenix quarantine independently encoded the required-active workflow set. The Airlock source admitted the maturation shadow, while Phoenix's hard-coded execution list and hard-coded verifier still reflected the older set. Execution and verification therefore agreed with each other while disagreeing with canonical policy.",
    "why_false_green_was_possible": "Phoenix mutation logic and its convergence verifier shared the same stale duplicate list, allowing the receipt to report VERIFIED even though a canonically required workflow was not active."
  },
